Hello,

this is the release of Konserve v0.8.1

Konserve is a small backup application for the KDE 3.x
environment. It lives in the system tray and is able to create
backups of several directories or files regularly.

This is a bugfix release:
* Check if files or directories are readable
* Removed the confirmation dialog when overwritting an
  old named backup archive
* Typos in the documentation fixed

You can get it on:

    http://www.simnacher.net/konserve/konserve.html

There is also a link to the documentation and screenshots.

Regards,

Florian Simnacher

