SPECIAL AWARDS

* Newcomer of the Year *
Typo3, Firebird, SGI Altix,...

* Institution / Organization / Company that has especially helped Linux *
EuroLinux, Open Source Now Fund (Red Hat), City of Munich, OSDL,...

